      <memberdef kind="function" id="namespacePanelBridge_1aa69b6d1d3413c31bbfa31a304fdeaa1c" prot="private" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void PanelBridge::setup</definition>
        <argsstring>()</argsstring>
        <name>setup</name>
        <qualifiedname>PanelBridge::setup</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Initialise STM32 board services, UART2, <ref refid="namespaceCANProtocol" kindref="compound">CANProtocol</ref>, and <ref refid="namespacePanelBridge" kindref="compound">PanelBridge</ref> internals. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Performs in order: <ref refid="namespaceSTM32Board_1a3785a13cc5ed58de231b71fd5e143f00" kindref="member">STM32Board::begin()</ref>, Serial.begin(250000), <ref refid="namespaceCANProtocol_1a438f275b91eb5d34ae85eeaa2a3505ea" kindref="member">CANProtocol::onStatusChange()</ref>, <ref refid="namespaceCANProtocol_1a0eb16415ae3e69aa8fc8601744219a87" kindref="member">CANProtocol::filterAcceptAll()</ref>, <ref refid="namespaceCANProtocol_1ab9d0d6bb169c659d369e630d1630c0e1" kindref="member">CANProtocol::onReceive()</ref> registration, <ref refid="namespaceCANProtocol_1a88802da4205140719f9714cb416f1b2c" kindref="member">CANProtocol::start()</ref>, arming the boot roster reply (written from loop()), and <ref refid="namespaceSTM32Board_1a5bd5eca4fdf29f15d237a990aa52fbf1" kindref="member">STM32Board::markBootHealthy()</ref> (#364). No SYNC_REQ: each node is queued for a sync as its first heartbeat arrives (#387). The DCS-BIOS export listener is a file-scope object, registered before setup() runs.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Sketch must call DcsBios::setup() immediately after this. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
