      <memberdef kind="function" id="namespacePanelBridge_1a25e0848858cec102349b882193e20efe" prot="private" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void PanelBridge::loop</definition>
        <argsstring>()</argsstring>
        <name>loop</name>
        <qualifiedname>PanelBridge::loop</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Run <ref refid="namespacePanelBridge" kindref="compound">PanelBridge</ref> work not owned by DcsBios::loop(). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Drains <ref refid="namespaceCANProtocol" kindref="compound">CANProtocol</ref> RX, dispatches EVT packets, services <ref refid="namespaceCANProtocol" kindref="compound">CANProtocol</ref> batching deadlines, checks node heartbeat timeouts (3 s), sends the next queued SYNC_REQ (one node at a time, #387), writes the next roster row when the UART has room (#388), sends its own HB_0 / HEALTH_0 through <ref refid="namespaceCANProtocol_1aee035f550086e47e9c533b9f547687f9" kindref="member">CANProtocol::serviceNodeStatus()</ref> (#340), and handles DiagSerial &apos;T&apos; bytes for TEST_SEQ.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Call after DcsBios::loop() each iteration. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
